  "content": "\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vedNWpA.png\" />\n    <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury%20API-required-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>模块化与升级！</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/47nTN8u.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>功能特性</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>保留升级数据</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">更换武器部件时，您的等级和进度将会被保存。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>物品升级</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">通过本模组，所有模块化武器均可完全升级！</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>为什么我应该使用此模组？</b></font>\n     <font size=\"4\">如果您在修改武器前已经为其升级过，现在您的进度将得以保留。没有此模组，进度会被重置为0级。这是WL旧版本中的功能，因此如果您使用的Weapon Leveling版本低于3.0.0，则不需要此模组。</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">将其拆分为独立模组是为了让未来的更新更加快速和高效。</font>\n    <br><br>\n    <font size=\"4\">使用此模组的另一个原因是增加了对Tetra所有武器类型的兼容性。您只需更改每种武器类型对应的可升级JSON文件，即可轻松自定义它们。\n</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">这是Weapon Leveling的官方附加模组</font>\n    <br>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/weapon-leveling\">\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uxu46dk.png\" width=\"90%\"/>\n    </a>\n    <br>\n \n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>附加模组信息</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\" >本附加模组由Weapon Leveling的作者GekidoLukas制作。关于此模组的所有问题请提交至<a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/wl_tetra_compat/issues\">该模组的Issue页面</a>。如需请求其他兼容附加模组，请访问<a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/weaponleveling/issues\">Weapon Leveling的Issue页面</a>进行反馈。</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
